@startuml kairos-admin-views-form-submissions-sequence
title Admin Views Form Submissions

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Admin -> WebAdmin: Open Form Submissions List
WebAdmin -> API: GET /forms/{id}/submissions?filters...
API -> DB: SELECT submissions + maybe summary
DB --> API: rows
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {submissions}

Admin -> WebAdmin: Click a submission
WebAdmin -> API: GET /forms/submissions/{submissionId}
API -> DB: SELECT submission + answers
DB --> API: detail
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {detail}

WebAdmin --> Admin: Show full submission

@enduml
